<table>
<tr><th>Condition</th><th>Conclusion about .equals()</th></tr>
<tr><td>Equal by .equals()</td><td>Hash codes must be equal</td></tr>
<tr><td>Not equal by .equals()</td><td>No restriction on hash codes (may be same or different)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hash codes equal</td><td>Cannot conclude about .equals() (may true or false)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hash codes not equal</td><td>Objects are always not equal by .equals()</td></tr>
